</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-sm rounded cursor-pointer flex flex-col gap-1 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary font-bold">04:30</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary uppercase">EN REPRODUCCIÓN</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface font-medium line-clamp-1">Imágenes de satélite de la nueva base</p>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">Pista de 1.800m y hangares protegidos</span>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high p-space-sm rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors flex flex-col gap-1">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">11:15</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">PARTE III</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface font-medium line-clamp-1">Capacidades antibuque de los arsenales</p>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">Misiles Noor, Al-Mandab y drones UAV</span>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high p-space-sm rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors flex flex-col gap-1">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">18:40</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline">PARTE IV</span>
</div>
